        "created_at": "2016-02-01T22:33:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm curious what combos people are pulling off to unlock this one, mine was:</p><p>Ambuscade -&gt; Tachyon -&gt; (Synaptic Interruption) -&gt; Stealth Bot -&gt; (Lead From the Front) -&gt; Legacy -&gt; (Stealth Bot) -&gt; Stealth Bot -&gt; (Smoke Bombs) -&gt; Tachyon -&gt; (Synaptic Interruption) -&gt; Ambuscade</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is by far my favorite achievement, it was fun to both think through how to do it and then to go about pulling it off.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:46:23.729Z",
