        "created_at": "2016-02-01T22:38:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We did Ambuscade to Tachyon -&gt; (Synaptic Interruption) -&gt; Nightmist -&gt; (Amulet) -&gt; Raptor Bot -&gt; (Smoke Bombs) -&gt; Tachyon -&gt; (Synaptic Interruption) -&gt; Legacy -&gt; (Stealth Bot) -&gt; Stealth Bot -&gt; Legacy (Lead from the Front), so we actually had 1 more than we needed.</p>",
