        "id": 158519,
        "name": "drengnikrafe",
        "username": "drengnikrafe",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/a4c791/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-02T04:34:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Neither lead from the front nor smoke bombs redirect damage from environment targets. It'll almost certainly have to be damage from a villain target that gets redirected. Any environment that doesn't harass your ongoings or equipment is fine, though you could make a case for Wagner Mars Base so the meteor swarm gives you all the time in the world to set up.</p>",
