        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/wite_c83/{size}/2042_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-10-27T21:37:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've tried this twice and every time it screws up at the&nbsp;&nbsp;Legacy -&gt; (Stealth Bot) portion. I'm not sure if it's a bug or I'm just missing something but instead of redirecting the damage to Legacy it just deals 3 projectial damage to Legacy. I got around this by allowing to redirect to Stealth Bot, then Legacy can Lead from the Front. It was realy weird because it even said it would redirect to Stealth Bot but it just didn't.</p>",
